### Normalized scores (1–100)

- **Tool use: 68/100.** Evidence TB ~55% ; GDPval ~1100; capped by missing Claw-Eval/Tau3 isolation.
- **Reasoning: 66/100.** Evidence GPQA ~75%; capped by incomplete HLE/MRCR.
- **Context window: 72/100.** Unknown — tiered per methodology (≥1M=95-100, 200K=70, 256K≈72).
- **Multimodal: 50/100.** Unknown; scored per multimodal rubric (text-only 15, image 60-70, video/PDF 75-90, audio-in 90-100).
- **Coding: 66/100.** Evidence LiveCode ~78% ; SciCode ~35%; capped by missing isolated LiveCode/SciCode where noted.
- **Cost efficiency: 65/100.** Paid ~$1.50/$6 per 1M.
- **Overall Score: 64/100.** Mean of five non-cost dims (68+66+72+50+66)/5=64.4 → 64; best-fit per scoring methodology.

